<section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap"><span class="eyebrow">App Privacy</span><h1>Khmer Expense Manager</h1><p>Privacy policy placeholder for the planned Khmer Expense Manager application.</p></div></section>
<section class="content"><div class="wrap prose"><p><strong>Status: Pre-release draft</strong></p><p>This app is still in planning. The final privacy policy will be updated before public testing or release to match the actual app implementation, permissions, SDKs, analytics, advertising, cloud services, and data handling.</p><h2>Planned privacy direction</h2><p>The product is being designed to minimize unnecessary collection of personal data. Where practical, financial records should remain under the user's control and only the data required for the app's actual functions should be processed.</p><h2>Before release</h2><p>This page will be reviewed against the final Android build and Google Play Data safety disclosures. It should not be treated as the final production privacy policy until the app is released.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>Questions can be sent through the Kroma Digital <a href="/contact">Contact page</a>.</p></div></section>
